		Click the "Update Routes" button
	Begin "Verify all routes listed in document properties"
		Navigate "?f=chart&v=encounter&pat_id=18&"
		Gridclick "Enc ID:82" "Properties" grid link
		Verify exists "Print" grid entry
		Verify exists "Fax" grid entry
		Verify exists "HL7 Send" grid entry
		Verify exists "Text Export" grid entry
		Verify exists "Dictaphone HL7" grid entry
		Verify exists "NMC - Cannot send (per physician)" grid entry
